# entropy-arb credentials / 密钥配置
#
#   cp .env.example .env     then fill in / 复制后填写
#
# Required to trade (the bot is live-only). Only --record-only data
# collection runs without credentials.
# 交易必填（本机器人只有实盘模式）。仅 --record-only 数据采集不需要密钥。
# NEVER commit .env / 切勿提交 .env 到 git。

# ===== Entropy — Hyperliquid (always required to trade) =====
# ===== Entropy — Hyperliquid 账户（交易必填） =====
# Create an API/agent wallet at https://app.hyperliquid.xyz/API — put the
# AGENT wallet's private key here and your main account address below.
# 在 https://app.hyperliquid.xyz/API 创建 API (agent) 钱包：
# 这里填 agent 钱包私钥，下面填你的主账户地址。
HL_PRIVATE_KEY=
HL_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS=

# ===== --hedge tradexyz (optional overrides) =====
# tradexyz shares the Hyperliquid account above by default. To trade it from
# a separate account/agent key, set these:
# 对冲腿为 tradexyz 时默认与上面共用同一 Hyperliquid 账户；
# 如需独立账户/密钥，填写以下两项：
#HL_PRIVATE_KEY_XYZ=
#HL_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS_XYZ=

# ===== Lighter mainnet / Lighter 主网 =====
# Used for either leg when its venue is lighter. Never used for lighter-rh.
# 主网专用，与基础腿 / 对冲腿无关，不会用于 Robinhood。
LIGHTER_ACCOUNT_INDEX=
LIGHTER_API_KEY_INDEX=
LIGHTER_API_PRIVATE_KEY=

# ===== Lighter Robinhood / Lighter Robinhood 独立凭证 =====
# Used for either leg when its venue is lighter-rh. No fallback to mainnet.
# Robinhood 专用；三项须完整填写，不会回退主网密钥。
LIGHTER_RH_ACCOUNT_INDEX=
LIGHTER_RH_API_KEY_INDEX=
LIGHTER_RH_API_PRIVATE_KEY=

# Migration: LIGHTER_BASE_* / LIGHTER_HEDGE_* are retired. Move each complete
# triple to its actual deployment above. Old shared LIGHTER_* keys belong in
# LIGHTER_RH_* if they were authorized on Robinhood; do not copy them to both.
# 迁移：旧 LIGHTER_BASE_* / LIGHTER_HEDGE_* 不再读取，按实际部署迁入对应三项。
# 旧共用 LIGHTER_* 若属于 Robinhood，请迁到 LIGHTER_RH_*，不要复制给两套部署。

# ===== --hedge katana =====
# ===== 对冲腿为 Katana Perps 时填写 =====
# Create an API key at https://perps.katana.network/wallet/api-keys/login
# with Trade scope. The API secret is shown ONCE — record it as generated.
# 在 Katana Perps 的 API keys 页面创建密钥（需 Trade 权限）。API secret 仅在
# 创建时显示一次。
#
# Two credential layers are needed, and they are NOT interchangeable:
#   * KATANA_API_KEY / KATANA_API_SECRET — HMAC request authentication only.
#   * a signing key — every order carries an EIP-712 signature; the on-chain
#     contract verifies it, so the API secret can never sign for you.
# 两套凭据缺一不可：API key/secret 只做请求认证（HMAC），订单本身必须由钱包做
# EIP-712 签名（链上合约校验），API secret 无法代签。
#
# Signing key options / 签名密钥两种方式：
#   1) the deposit wallet's own key / 直接用手存保证金的钱包私钥
#   2) a delegated (session) key — preferred: it cannot withdraw funds, expires
#      after ~30 days and is revocable. Create it in the web UI, then set
#      KATANA_WALLET to the DEPOSIT wallet and KATANA_PRIVATE_KEY to the
#      session key's private key.
# 推荐方式 2：在网页创建 session key（交易专用、不能提现、约 30 天过期、可撤销），
# 然后把 KATANA_WALLET 填【存保证金的钱包地址】、KATANA_PRIVATE_KEY 填
# 【session key 的私钥】。两者不同时，引擎会自动在订单结构里声明委托密钥。
KATANA_API_KEY=
KATANA_API_SECRET=
KATANA_PRIVATE_KEY=
# Required when KATANA_PRIVATE_KEY is a session key (i.e. != the deposit wallet)
# 用 session key 时【必须】填，否则引擎会把 session key 地址当成账户
#KATANA_WALLET=

# ===== --base / --hedge backpack =====
# ===== Backpack Exchange（任一条腿在 Backpack 时填写）=====
# Create an API key on the exchange's API settings page with TRADE-only
# permissions (never enable withdrawals). Two values, and they are NOT
# interchangeable:
#   * BACKPACK_API_KEY   — the API key itself: the base64 Ed25519 VERIFYING
#                          key (public), shown in the key list
#   * BACKPACK_API_SECRET — the base64 32-byte private seed shown ONCE at
#                          creation; every request is Ed25519-signed with it
# 在交易所的 API 设置页创建密钥（只开 Trade 权限，绝不开提现）。两个值缺一不可：
#   API key 就是 base64 的 Ed25519 验证公钥；secret 是创建时仅显示一次的
#   base64 32 字节私钥种子——每个请求都用它做 Ed25519 签名。
BACKPACK_API_KEY=
BACKPACK_API_SECRET=

# ===== --base / --hedge bulk =====
# ===== bulk.trade（任一条腿在 bulk 时填写）=====
# ONE credential: the base58 Solana Ed25519 secret key. The wallet pubkey IS
# your bulk account address (deposit USDC there); account-state queries and
# the private account stream need no further auth. Accepts the 32-byte seed
# or the full 64-byte keypair — Phantom's "Export Private Key" value works
# as-is. Order signing uses the official bulk-keychain package
# (pip install bulk-keychain — Python 3.9–3.13, see requirements-live.txt).
# 唯一凭据：base58 的 Solana Ed25519 私钥。钱包公钥即 bulk 账户地址（USDC 充
# 值到该账户）；账户查询与私有推送无需额外认证。32 字节种子或 64 字节完整
# keypair 均可——Phantom 的"导出私钥"值可直接粘贴。下单签名使用官方
# bulk-keychain 包（仅支持 Python 3.9–3.13，见 requirements-live.txt）。
BULK_SECRET_KEY=

# ===== --base / --hedge ondo =====
# ===== Ondo Perps（任一条腿在 ondo 时填写）=====
# Create an API key in the Ondo Perps web UI (API Keys page) — Trade scope,
# no withdrawal. ONE pair authenticates everything: REST (ONDO-* HMAC
# headers) AND the private websocket (time + "ondo_perps_ws_login"). No
# wallet signature needed; headless-safe. Optional IP whitelist available.
# 在 Ondo Perps 网页端创建 API key（只开交易权限，绝不开提现）。同一对密钥
# 认证 REST（ONDO-* HMAC 头）和私有 websocket——无需钱包签名，可无人值守。
ONDO_KEY_ID=
ONDO_API_SECRET=

# ===== --base / --hedge arcus =====
# ===== Arcus（任一条腿在 arcus 时填写）=====
# At app.arcus.xyz/api-keys: Generate -> save API Signing Key -> Authorize.
# ADDRESS = the connected wallet's 0x address. API_KEY = the displayed public
# API Key (64 hex). SECRET_KEY = API Signing Key shown ONCE at generation
# (64 hex seed, NOT your wallet private key). If lost, generate and authorize
# a new pair: the public API Key alone cannot sign or recover the private key.
# Optional ARCUS_ACCOUNT_INDEX=0 (0-9, must match key scope).
# Testnet: ARCUS_TESTNET=1; create the key at testnet.arcus.xyz/api-keys.
# 在 app.arcus.xyz/api-keys 点击 Generate -> 保存 API Signing Key -> Authorize。
# ADDRESS 填连接的钱包 0x 地址；API_KEY 填页面显示的 API Key 公钥（64 位 hex）；
# SECRET_KEY 填生成时只显示一次的 API Signing Key（64 位 hex，不是钱包私钥）。
# 如未保存签名私钥，需重新生成并授权，不能只靠 API Key 找回。
# 子账户 ARCUS_ACCOUNT_INDEX 默认 0（0-9，须匹配授权范围）；测试网设 ARCUS_TESTNET=1。
ARCUS_ADDRESS=
ARCUS_API_KEY=
ARCUS_SECRET_KEY=

# ===== --base / --hedge perpl =====
# ===== Perpl（任一条腿在 perpl 时填写）=====
# Create an API key at app.perpl.xyz/apikeys — the UI hands you the opaque
# token AND the Ed25519 private key ONCE. Same pair signs REST and the
# trading websocket. Keys never move funds (withdrawals need a wallet
# signature). Trading also needs an ON-CHAIN exchange account (createAccount
# via the app — until then signed reads answer 404). Testnet: PERPL_TESTNET=1.
# NOTE: every order lives at most order_ttl_blocks (~6 s on mainnet) —
# maker quotes self-expire; the engine re-quotes continuously.
# 在 app.perpl.xyz/apikeys 创建 API key——token 和 Ed25519 私钥只显示一次，
# 同一对密钥签 REST 和交易 websocket。密钥永不能动资金（提现需钱包签名）。
# 交易还需链上交易账户（App 内 createAccount，否则签名读返回 404）。测试网
# 设 PERPL_TESTNET=1。注意：所有订单最长活约 6 秒，挂单会自动过期重挂。
PERPL_API_KEY=
PERPL_API_KEY_SECRET=
